          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF and Select friends from Legends of Marr visit the hidden City of Chardok . . .                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">November 24th: 5 Groups of SoF with some LoM friends visited the bowels of Chardok today to work on Cleric / Chanter epic pieces.  As this was SoF's first largescale raid on this zone we had a lot to learn, but all in all walked away richer in experience and knowledge.<br><br>Congratulations extend out to <br><br>Lladriel on her enchanter epic piece.<br><br>Haletma on his cleric epic drop.<br><br>Legends of Marr on their:<br><br>Di'zok Imperial Katana <br>Races: ALL - Classes: WAR PAL RNG SHD (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 35 - Dly: 43 - Wt: 0.5 - Type: 2hs - Damage Per Second: 16.51<br>Attributes: STR+12 INT+5 WIS+5 MANA+30 SV POISON+5 SV DISEASE+5 SV MAGIC+5 <br>Comment: Found in Chardok.<br>Average Price: 24,800 <br><br><br>Waryon on his:<br><br>Incarnadine Breastplate <br>Races: HUM BAR ERU ELF HIE DEF HEF DWF TRL OGR HFL GNM - Classes: WAR SHD (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 35 - Wt: 7 - Slot: chest<br>Attributes: STR+15 DEX+15 INT+5 HP+25 <br>Effect: Gather Shadows<br><br>and Taldaria on her:<br><br>Nathsar Breastplate <br>Races: ALL - Classes: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD DRU BRD ROG MNK SHM BST (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 18 - Wt: 1.5 - Slot: chest<br>Attributes: STR+6 AGI+6 WIS+6 SV DISEASE+5 SV FIRE+5 <br>Comment: Found in Chardok.<br>Average Price: 5,800 <br><br>Unfortunately, about 30 minutes before the next king pop the raid pushed a mob through the wall - which caused it to reset to bind point and brought down the ravaging Chardoki masses upon us.<br><br>Special thanks out to Ladey of SoF and Morpain of DBN for chain summoning 30 corpses out from the TPW site.  Thanks to Draksus for the click stick rez's as well.<br><br>Further, I must commend myself for an awesome job of pulling Chardok - bringing the entire prince room at full pop back to the raid was a stroke of genius.  I planned that.  Really I did.  ;)<br><br>And thus ends our broadcast day . . .<br>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             